### =====================================================
### 보유 예금 API 테스트 (화면 07-01 ~ 07-11)
### 공용 api.http와 충돌을 피하기 위해 별도 파일로 분리
###
### 모든 엔드포인트가 인증 필수입니다.
### 0번(로그인)을 먼저 실행해 토큰을 발급받으세요.
### =====================================================

### 0. 로그인 - 토큰 발급
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hong@kb.co.kr",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 1. 목록 조회 (화면 02-03, 07-09)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 개수 (화면 07-01 우상단 뱃지)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deposits/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 상세 (화면 07-10 진입)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deposits/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 등록 - 정상 (화면 07-01)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "KB국민은행",
  "productName": "KB Star 정기예금",
  "joinDate": "20250101",
  "maturityDate": "20270101",
  "principalAmount": 50000000,
  "baseRate": 3.000,
  "appliedRate": 3.500
}

### 4-1. 등록 실패 - 상품명 누락 (화면 07-02)
### 기대: 400 { errorCode: REQUIRED_FIELD, field: productName }
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "KB국민은행",
  "productName": "",
  "joinDate": "20250101",
  "maturityDate": "20270101",
  "principalAmount": 50000000,
  "baseRate": 3.000,
  "appliedRate": 3.500
}

### 4-2. 등록 실패 - 적용금리 누락
### 기대: 400 { errorCode: REQUIRED_FIELD, field: appliedRate }
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "KB국민은행",
  "productName": "KB Star 정기예금",
  "joinDate": "20250101",
  "maturityDate": "20270101",
  "principalAmount": 50000000,
  "baseRate": 3.000
}

### 4-3. 등록 실패 - 날짜 역전 (화면 07-03)
### 기대: 400 { errorCode: INVALID_DATE, field: maturityDate }
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "KB국민은행",
  "productName": "KB Star 정기예금",
  "joinDate": "20270101",
  "maturityDate": "20250101",
  "principalAmount": 50000000,
  "baseRate": 3.000,
  "appliedRate": 3.500
}

### 4-4. 등록 실패 - 적용금리 < 기본금리
### 기대: 400 { errorCode: INVALID_RATE, field: appliedRate }
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "KB국민은행",
  "productName": "KB Star 정기예금",
  "joinDate": "20250101",
  "maturityDate": "20270101",
  "principalAmount": 50000000,
  "baseRate": 3.500,
  "appliedRate": 3.000
}

### 4-5. 등록 실패 - 날짜 형식 오류 (하이픈 포함)
### 기대: 400 { errorCode: INVALID_DATE }
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "KB국민은행",
  "productName": "KB Star 정기예금",
  "joinDate": "2025-01-01",
  "maturityDate": "20270101",
  "principalAmount": 50000000,
  "baseRate": 3.000,
  "appliedRate": 3.500
}

### 5. 수정 (화면 07-10)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/deposits/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "KB국민은행",
  "productName": "KB아이사랑예금",
  "joinDate": "20260314",
  "maturityDate": "20280314",
  "principalAmount": 7000000,
  "baseRate": 2.000,
  "appliedRate": 3.800
}

### 5-1. 수정 실패 - 없는 ID
### 기대: 404 { errorCode: DEPOSIT_NOT_FOUND }
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/deposits/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "KB국민은행",
  "productName": "KB아이사랑예금",
  "joinDate": "20260314",
  "maturityDate": "20280314",
  "principalAmount": 7000000,
  "baseRate": 2.000,
  "appliedRate": 3.800
}

### 6. 삭제 (화면 07-11)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/deposits/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6-1. 삭제 후 재조회
### 기대: 404 (soft delete 되어 조회 안 됨)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deposits/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 없는 ID 조회
### 기대: 404 { errorCode: DEPOSIT_NOT_FOUND }
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deposits/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 토큰 없이 호출
### 기대: 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
